{"symbol":"ABRFL","yahoo":"ABRFL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Abram Food Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","website":"https://www.abramfood.in","about":"Abram Food Limited engages in the manufacturing and trading of fast-moving consumer goods. The company offers chana, kabuli chana, chana dal, and chana churi/chilka; flour includes multi grain and chakki fresh atta, maida, besan, and sooji; barley; moong; wheat; spices such as rock and black salt, jeera, chilli and coriander powder, garam masala, and amchur powder; and cattle feed. It also provides edible oils such as crude degummed soya oil, crude palm oil, maize refined oil, mustard oil, RBD palmolein oil and refined soyabean oil. The company sells its products under the KHERLIWALA, Rajasthan Royal, Karwaan, Double Moonch, ORIGO Natural, and Black Buck brands. Abram Food Limited was incorporated in 2009 and is based in Alwar, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T11:11:23+00:00","quote":{"price":35.49,"prevClose":33.8,"marketCap":18.29,"high52":143.9,"low52":33.5,"pe":7.26,"bookValue":45.1,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":14.84,"shares":0.5154,"insiders":67.33,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-07-01","2025-07-02","2025-07-03","2025-07-04","2025-07-07","2025-07-08","2025-07-09","2025-07-10","2025-07-11","2025-07-14","2025-07-15","2025-07-16","2025-07-17","2025-07-18","2025-07-21","2025-07-22","2025-07-23","2025-07-24","2025-07-25","2025-07-28","2025-07-29","2025-07-30","2025-07-31","2025-08-01","2025-08-04","2025-08-05","2025-08-06","2025-08-07","2025-08-08","2025-08-11","2025-08-12","2025-08-13","2025-08-14","2025-08-18","2025-08-19","2025-08-20","2025-08-21","2025-08-22","2025-08-25","2025-08-26","2025-08-28","2025-08-29","2025-09-01","2025-09-02","2025-09-03","2025-09-04","2025-09-05","2025-09-08","2025-09-09","2025-09-10","2025-09-11","2025-09-12","2025-09-15","2025-09-16","2025-09-17","2025-09-18","2025-09-19","2025-09-22","2025-09-23","2025-09-24","2025-09-25","202